OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad search prompts
OL,4,Aovernight evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents evacuated from a street in
OL,7,FSheffield after bomb disposal experts
OL,8,Fwere called have spent the night away
OL,9,Ffrom their homes.
OL,11,FA 328ft (100m) cordon was put in place
OL,12,Faround a property in Mapplebeck Road,
OL,13,Fin High Green, on Tuesday, following a
OL,14,Fforensic search which began last week.
OL,16,FSouth Yorkshire Police said a
OL,17,F35-year-old woman had been charged
OL,18,Funder the Explosive Substances Act on
OL,19,FMonday as a result of the operation and
OL,20,Fhad been remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
