OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad search prompts
OL,4,Aovernight evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday the force said the cordon
OL,7,Fwas "expected to remain in place
OL,8,Fthroughout today" while work to make
OL,9,Fthe area safe continued, with a number
OL,10,Fof roads closed as a result.
